{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n陳柏宇太太符曉薇（Leanne）與7歲女兒Abi尼泊爾之旅來到尾聲，原定行程因天氣告吹，卻意外迎來驚喜！兩母女轉遊猴廟，竟發現尼泊爾版「阿笨與阿占」奇景，Leanne更自爆購物狂基因完美遺傳女兒，究竟Abi的戰利品有幾誇張？\n</p>\n<h2>行程突變Leanne平常心面對 「慢慢放下腳步」</h2>\n<p>在昨晚（2日）播出的節目中，Leanne與7歲囡囡陳羿辰（Abi）的尼泊爾之旅來到最後一天。原定乘坐小型飛機觀賞野生動物的行程，可惜因天氣不似預期而被迫取消。面對突如其來的變故，Leanne不但沒有失望，反而笑言旅行就是要學懂接受，並向女兒灌輸正面心態：「有時就係咁樣，就算 plan 好晒所有嘢，一個不可預期嘅事情，都會令你計劃改變。不過唔緊要，慢慢放下腳步，就會睇到美麗景色。」她慶幸兩母女心態調整得很快，輕鬆應對旅途上的突發狀況。</p>\n<h2>轉遊猴廟驚見尼泊爾版阿笨與阿占</h2>\n<p>行程更改後，Leanne帶Abi改去參觀加德滿都著名的馬騮寺廟，知道可以近距離接觸動物的Abi顯得非常興奮。廟內的猴子因經常被餵食，所以完全不怕人，更會主動親近遊客。旅程中，Abi更意外發現了尼泊爾版「阿笨與阿占」的奇趣組合，一隻猴子竟悠然自得地騎在狗狗身上，關係非常密切，畫面十分有趣。被問到此行心情時，Abi一臉喜悅地大讚媽咪安排得好：「梗係滿足啦，媽咪好叻呢度又可以睇到雀仔、狗狗同馬騮。」她更直言這天是整個行程中最開心的一天。</p>\n<h2>符曉薇自爆購物狂基因 7歲Abi完美遺傳狂掃手信</h2>\n<p>除了與動物作近距離接觸，Leanne在節目中更自爆是天生購物狂，但笑言婚後已有改善。沒想到，女兒Abi卻完美遺傳了她的購物狂基因。在參觀寺廟期間，年僅7歲的Abi化身小富婆，在廟內的市集瘋狂掃貨，對各種飾物、手鏈愛不釋手，甚至連經輪都不放過，買得不亦樂乎，盡顯購物狂本色，讓Leanne哭笑不得。</p>\n<h2>網民大讚Abi可愛 「盡得媽咪真傳」</h2>\n<p>不少觀眾看完節目後都大讚Abi天真可愛，對她遺傳媽咪購物狂基因的反應感到好笑。網民紛紛留言：「馬騮騎住隻狗仔好得意！真係好似阿笨與阿占！」、「7歲就識得掃貨，果然盡得媽咪真傳，哈哈！」、「Leanne心態好好，識得教個女接受突發事，呢啲先係旅行嘅意義。」、「Abi真係好可愛，睇佢買嘢個樣好滿足！」、「呢個旅程好有意義，唔係淨係飲飲食食。」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_189090556ae980b0272c2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/14_189090556ae980b0272c2.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_11990219596ae980b8e0a18.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/15_11990219596ae980b8e0a18.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_5180622206ae980c077548.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/16_5180622206ae980c077548.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_6048928756ae980c7b0ea6.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17_6048928756ae980c7b0ea6.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_5319280246ae980cf84f5f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_5319280246ae980cf84f5f.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_1289596876ae980dbdc886.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_1289596876ae980dbdc886.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_14132501336ae980ec61ec3.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_14132501336ae980ec61ec3.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_18672017086ae980f79ecc4.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_18672017086ae980f79ecc4.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_12842643706ae981004e4e2.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/22_12842643706ae981004e4e2.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:02:10.696743+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1268,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T10:30:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:58:51.769071+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T10:59:13.979858+00:00","content_hash":"7a564481aeb950b713eb77225e14a117dc32230c94c0e8475e511091a5050b8f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}